Voom includes a modified build of gvproxy from containers/gvisor-tap-vsock.

Upstream source: https://github.com/containers/gvisor-tap-vsock
Upstream revision: 9cfc86f66679ef0feed0f20ba1df558fe2bef5c6
Upstream version: v0.8.9

Voom adds private gateway forwarding, blocks guest access to host-only services,
and fixes UDP datagram forwarding and session cleanup. The changes are in
nix/patches/gvproxy-gateway-forward.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-modification-notices.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-udp-forward.patch, and
nix/patches/gvproxy-forward-outcomes.patch in the Voom source repository.

